{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852731936349880390","index_path":"messages/852731936349880390/index.json","message_count":780,"name":"the-bustle🛒🔮","position":71,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"A large market district in the center of Ferrytown that borders on and overlaps with several natural areas. If you want strange curios and other oddities, this is where you go. The shops are run by Seelie fey during the day and Unseelie fey during the night, meaning that different products may be available at different times.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Staaten Wastes","id":"852734657850245140","index_path":"messages/852734657850245140/index.json","message_count":0,"name":"hellshow vc","position":11,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"2"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852737863170654259","index_path":"messages/852737863170654259/index.json","message_count":1964,"name":"the-isle-of-fae🎪💫","position":73,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Illo’fae is a large fairground at the South of burrough. Entirely fairground/amusement park, including park areas. This is the perfect place to spend a sunny day off enjoying various games, shows, and delicacies. It is also home to a luxury hotel structured entirely of the surrounding trees.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852738741537865769","index_path":"messages/852738741537865769/index.json","message_count":1822,"name":"sunrise-port🌄🚢","position":82,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Near the north end of Ferrytown and in full view of The City, the Sunrise Port is the main ferry port transporting between Ferrytown and The City, as well as up the channels to Kingsbridge.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852739008332431372","index_path":"messages/852739008332431372/index.json","message_count":930,"name":"sunset-port🌅🚢","position":83,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"West of The Hilltops, the Sunset Port is the main ferry port transporting across the river from the Empire City.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852739266517794827","index_path":"messages/852739266517794827/index.json","message_count":487,"name":"twighlight-port🌠🚢","position":84,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Just north of Coney Island, the Twilight Port is the main ferry port transporting between Ferrytown and the Staten Wastes.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852739507647545364","index_path":"messages/852739507647545364/index.json","message_count":1839,"name":"hilltops🦝🍄","position":75,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852741576237121561","index_path":"messages/852741576237121561/index.json","message_count":1084,"name":"the-mounds🕷🕸","position":79,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"A major feywild park on the east edge of Ferrytown, the mostly flat but with small mounds of earth terrain of The Mounds makes it home to many fey who live under the small mounds. Its proximity to Hampstead and the associated gloom means it is a main dwelling place for Unseelie fey. It is also home to Whitehollow Cemetery, a fey graveyard filled with white birch trees; and the blessed tangle, a large tree home to temples to various spider deities","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852742103855267860","index_path":"messages/852742103855267860/index.json","message_count":183,"name":"risehall💸🌇","position":78,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852742259073744937","index_path":"messages/852742259073744937/index.json","message_count":3670,"name":"jameco🍄🌳","position":80,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Named for the original human residents, Jameco is a community built primarily of these native peoples and fey bleed over. It is home to the Ferrytown court and resides between The Mounds and Grassy Bay. The sacred tree, Cael'fii, grows here.","type":"0"}
