{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"854826651169587252","index_path":"messages/854826651169587252/index.json","message_count":274,"name":"shop-herbs-herbs-🧪🌿","position":88,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"A shorter human looking man named Herb runs this shop. Hes always got a smile on his face and a warm greeting for his customers. He seems to be about 25, wears an apron, and his hair seems to change color every few months. His beard is always adorned with salmon colored flowers with yellow tips.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"854829166561067029","index_path":"messages/854829166561067029/index.json","message_count":124,"name":"shop-gregarious-gauntlets🌲🛡","position":89,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"This stall is run by a large bugbear man who talks in extremely dramatic fashion. Many of his pieces of armor are fancy and catching to the eye. He ages his whole lifespan over the course of a day, his taste and required gifts changing with him. The interior of the stall, which is an open-air blacksmithy with a small room in the back for sleeping, has several clocks strewn about. Unlike many of the other shops in Ferrytown which take on a different tone and goods during the night, this shop is instead closed as the bugbear begins to die at sunset and is reborn and ages enough to manage the shop by sunrise.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"854830883563110440","index_path":"messages/854830883563110440/index.json","message_count":298,"name":"shop-wilhelms-wearable-wonders👗🔮","position":87,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"This shop is run by Seelie fey during the day and Unseelie fey from dusk to dawn. Wilhelm is rarely seen but often can be heard cackling to himself in his shop in the back. Items can be purchased for gold value or a deal can be struck.","type":"0"}
