{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"862869435940339732","index_path":"messages/862869435940339732/index.json","message_count":349,"name":"grassy-bay-bleed🏝🛶","position":86,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"The estuary-bay occupying the southeast coast of Ferrytown is home to large swaths of coastal feywild parks, many of which are islands. These parks are frequently used by smugglers to avoid watchful eyes, as it is exceedingly difficult to track a shipment that passes in and out of the feywild. The large swath near spitside is home to a large orchard.","type":"0"}
{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"862869528059576360","index_path":"messages/862869528059576360/index.json","message_count":1261,"name":"spitside🚤🌑","position":85,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Ferrytown area of spit protruding from Hampstead. East side of the area is home to several ports used for both legitimate and illegitimate shipping, while the west section is one of the wilder feywild bleed-overs and a part of the Grassy Bay Bleed.","type":"0"}
